# Bloodforged Battle-Axe: a token copy of the Equipment has all its abilities (CR 707.2), and each Axe on the creature
# triggers separately (CR 603.2c). On turn 3 the equipped Ornithopter (2/2) connects for 2 and the Axe copies itself; in
# the second main phase Bot1 pays {2} to equip the token to the Ornithopter too (+2/+0 from each: a 4/2). On turn 5 it
# connects for 4 and both Axes trigger, making two more tokens: four Axes in all, and Bot2 at 14.

